1	/****************************************************************************
2	 * app/velaguard/vg_voice_round.c
3	 *
4	 * BVO-11/12: the voice round from the button to the speaker.
5	 *
6	 * One worker thread owns the pipeline.  The button callback only posts an
7	 * event and raises the cancel flag, so a press during recognition, waiting or
8	 * playback is noticed within one transport slice rather than at the end of
9	 * the stage.
10	 *
11	 * The answer shown and the answer spoken come from the snapshot the agent's
12	 * read-only tool published, not from the model's prose.  The model still runs
13	 * the round and calls the tool; its text is used only when every number in it
14	 * appears in that snapshot.
15	 ****************************************************************************/
